Package: statcheckml
Title: R Port of 'statcheck-ml'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rasoul", "Norouzi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rslnorouzi@gmail.com")
Description: A port of 'statcheck-ml', a machine-learned replacement for the
    extraction step of the R package 'statcheck'. The package reads a PDF or
    plain text, finds every reported statistical test result with a
    character-level model shipped in a verified kit, recomputes each
    result's p-value with closed-form arithmetic, and reports whether the
    reported and the recomputed p-values agree. The model only finds
    results; it never judges them. The kit of rules, the character
    vocabulary, and the p-value constants are exported by the mother
    project and read here, not restated.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/rasoulnorouzi/statcheck-ml-r
BugReports: https://github.com/rasoulnorouzi/statcheck-ml-r/issues
